<InfoPage title="About Dreemy AI Guide" kicker="About this publication" description="An independent editorial guide to Dreemy AI roleplay, characters, bot creation, AI image and video tools, privacy, and alternatives."><h2>Our purpose</h2><p>We help adults understand what to test before investing time or money in an AI character platform. Coverage focuses on roleplay quality, character consistency, memory, bot controls, media generation, privacy, deletion, and credit transparency.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>This is not the official Dreemy AI website and is not operated by or endorsed by Dreemy AI. Official links are labeled and open dreemy.ai. Product features, rules, prices, and availability can change, so verify material details before paying.</p><h2>Editorial method</h2><p>Each article answers a specific decision question, distinguishes observed product positioning from editorial judgment, cites primary sources, and shows publication and review dates. We do not publish bulk pages that merely swap product names.</p></InfoPage>
